# The digest of each version of the Slack plugin package, plugins/slack: one line per version, the version, a space, and
# the sha256 of the whole package as the runtime computes it — the number `jason plugin list` shows for an installed copy.
# It is the digest of the package a release publishes; it is not the archive's checksum in `checksums.txt`.
# The list starts with 1.0.0 and holds every version the package has had, published or not, because every bump appends a line.
# A version is its content: any change to a file of the package is a new version, and a new version appends its line at
# the end, after the last edit to the package, since every edit changes the digest; once the version is bumped, the
# package's test prints the line to append. A line already here is never changed, and a line that changes or disappears
# in a diff is refused in review.
1.0.0 sha256:cba4bc14aa70fd27feceb24ebdb608149fe4648ff35fde4940927c2133e448c9
